  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pilot Phase for Geothermal Energy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at strengthening capacity of Indian partners, including researchers, and stakeholders for performing independent feasibility studies for harnessing geothermal energy. It will also demonstrate a pilot project utilizing geothermal energy for heating / cooling.</narrative>
